{"unit_id":"MoRanYue__dsh-openrouter-providers#feature-1","repo":"MoRanYue/dsh-openrouter-providers","commit":"2cf07daa406cd98e6ba62aa74e90506d4f450421","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openrouter-providers 的功能「提供商限制」：配置全局提供商列表与 only 或 order 模式，并注入匹配请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1314","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"MoRanYue__dsh-openrouter-providers#feature-2","repo":"MoRanYue/dsh-openrouter-providers","commit":"2cf07daa406cd98e6ba62aa74e90506d4f450421","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openrouter-providers 的功能「逐模型路由」：添加按模型名称或通配模式匹配的规则；命中时使用该规则的提供商列表和模式覆盖全局设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:405","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"MoRanYue__dsh-openrouter-providers#feature-3","repo":"MoRanYue/dsh-openrouter-providers","commit":"2cf07daa406cd98e6ba62aa74e90506d4f450421","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openrouter-providers 的功能「量化与服务层级」：选择量化限制和 OpenRouter 服务层级；插件将 quantizations 写入 provider 参数，并将 service_tier 写入请求顶层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1329","lib/client.js:1"]}
